  "notes": "Used for official, formal statements typically by governments, organizations, or public figures.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{声明|せいめい}を{発表|はっぴょう}する (to issue a statement)\n・{声明|せいめい}を{出|だ}す (to put out a statement)\n・{共同|きょうどう}{声明|せいめい} (joint statement)\n・{公式|こうしき}{声明|せいめい} (official statement)\n・{声明|せいめい}{文|ぶん} (text of a statement)\n\nHOMOPHONE:\n・{姓名|せいめい} - full name (surname + given name)\n・{生命|せいめい} - life (biological)\n\nThese three words are all read せいめい but have completely different meanings.",
